/**
 * AI abstraction layer — scaffold only.
 *
 * All AI interactions must go through this server-side abstraction.
 * NEVER call AI APIs directly from Client Components or expose API keys to the browser.
 *
 * This directory will contain:
 *   - client.ts    → Configured AI SDK client (server-only)
 *   - prompts/     → System prompts and prompt templates
 *   - actions/     → Server Actions that invoke AI features
 *
 * Medical safety constraints (enforced at the prompt layer):
 *   - AI must not diagnose or prescribe.
 *   - AI must not claim certainty about disease.
 *   - AI must not invent missing medical values.
 *   - AI-generated content must be clearly distinguishable from original records.
 */
